2026-11-06T03:02:14.4585870Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-06T03:02:14.4586233Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-06T03:02:14.4586560Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-06T03:02:14.4586980Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-06T03:02:14.4587383Z    /root
2026-11-06T03:02:14.4601064Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-06T03:02:14.4601857Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-06T03:02:14.4614224Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-06T03:02:14.4614881Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-06T03:02:14.4615343Z 
